WEBVTT

00:00:03.008 --> 00:00:13.013
News — regulators just said agents can start making payments. Phase one is coffee, they said.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:18.026
Deploy more agents! Payment squad, deploy!

00:00:18.026 --> 00:00:25.044
Hold on, let's infer first. A three-thousand-won budget statistically buys gummy bears.

00:00:28.855 --> 00:00:32.429
…that's not a payment. That's a snack.

00:00:32.429 --> 00:00:35.049
Statistically, that's a success.

00:00:35.049 --> 00:00:44.051
Why didn't it break? The card data was on this boat the whole time. The box is ours.

00:00:44.051 --> 00:00:50.490
Agent payments, phase one: complete. The data didn't move.

